Title: GOBASIC v3.3 for desktop
Developer: Luyao Zou
Date: Sept 2014
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Feature Updated:
>> Clarify unit conversions:
   Throughout GOBASIC, column density (nt) is always in cm^-2;
   velocity width and shift are always in km/s;
   In 'maxtempcalc.m', line frequency is in Hz;
   In 'molsim.m', line frequency is in MHz

>> Fix bug in error propagation.
   Meanwhile, the user can choose to propogate the uncertainty either from
   the goodness of the fit, or the noise level of the observation from the
   raw telescope data before deconvolution.
   Details of error propagation pls see the appendix of the GOBASIC paper.

>> Fix an error of matrix dimention mismatch when only one molecular line
   exists in the spectra range.

>> Make the display of results more readable in matlab terminal

>> Add header to output csv files. Header contains program version info.


